# graphify: the post-commit hook rewrites graphify-out/ after every commit, so
# tracking it leaves a dirty tree on each commit and breaks the clean-worktree
# rule in AGENTS.md. Track only the semantic cache — it is LLM output and costs
# tokens to rebuild. Everything else regenerates for free via `graphify update`.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/cache/*
!graphify-out/cache/semantic/
